msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, how's it going? I'm a scout for a hostess club.\\r\nInterested?"
msgstr "¡Mucho gusto! Soy un reclutador de un hostess club, ¿te interesa?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "140_Subdued Woman"
msgid "A hostess club, huh? I don't know..."
msgstr "¿Un hostess club? No me van mucho ese tipo de cosas..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I understand completely. You probably have some\\r\nobjections to the industry. But you know..."
msgstr "Ah, ya veo. Supongo que esos clubs pueden ser un poco desagradables, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "Just do your best, and you'll be raking in the cash."
msgstr "Pero si haces bien tu trabajo puedes ganar muchísimo dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "176_Subdued Woman"
msgid "I do need money, but not that badly!"
msgstr "Me hace falta dinero, ¡pero no estoy tan desesperada!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "188_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, I see..."
msgstr "Ah, ya veo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "200_Subdued Woman"
msgid "I'm not interested in the sex industry! Get lost!"
msgstr "¡No me interesa trabajar en cosas sexuales! ¡Ya vete!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "(Yikes. Blew that one...)"
msgstr "(Caray, supongo que la espanté...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "Haven't you heard? Working as a hostess is a dream job for\\r\nyoung women these days. In fact, hostess club fashion mags\\r\nare all the rage."
msgstr "¿Sabías que hoy en día trabajar en un club de hostess es el trabajo soñado de muchas chicas? De hecho, las revistas de moda para hostess se venden como pan caliente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "272_Subdued Woman"
msgid "Huh? Really?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "Really. Are you sure a cute girl like you wouldn't be\\r\ninterested?"
msgstr "De verdad. ¿Por qué una chica linda como tú no estaría interesada?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "296_Subdued Woman"
msgid "Me, cute? Gosh..."
msgstr "¿Yo? ¿Linda? Vaya..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "308_Akiyama"
msgid "It's true! Sure, there's plenty of cute girls around here,\\r\nbut they're not the ones who caught my eye."
msgstr "¡Lo digo en serio! Hay miles de mujeres en estas zonas, pero ninguna me llamó la atención tanto como tú."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Be pretty great to make yourself even more fabulous, no?"
msgstr "¿No te gustaría pulir aún más tu belleza?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "332_Subdued Woman"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "S-sí..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "Here's my card, then. Can I get your number?"
msgstr "Tome, aquí tiene mi tarjeta. ¿Podría darme su número de teléfono?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "356_Subdued Woman"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "Sí..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "380_Akiyama"
msgid "All right, I'll be in touch!"
msgstr "¡Perfecto! ¡Te llamaré más tarde!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "There's a lot of money in it."
msgstr "Puedes ganar mucho dinero"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "This just might be your dream job."
msgstr "Este podría ser el trabajo de tus sueños"

